<title>HONG KONG: First Tractor floats 300 mln H-shrs at HK$4.50/shr.</title>
<headline>First Tractor floats 300 mln H-shrs at HK$4.50/shr.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agricultural tractor maker First Tractor Co Ltd said on Tuesday it is offering 300 million H-shares, or 40 percent of the company's enlarged share capital, in a global flotation at HK$4.50 per share.</p>
</text>
